# MyFinances — environment variables
#
# This file documents available env vars. The automated setup (setup.sh /
# setup.ps1) handles these for you. If you are configuring manually (e.g.
# Portainer's "Environment variables" UI or a bare docker run), set these
# values in your deployment tool and place the postgres password in
# secrets/postgres_password.txt as a Docker secret.
#
# DATABASE_URL is NOT listed here because it is constructed from the Docker
# secret at container startup — never pass the password as an env var.

# How long a login session stays valid (days). Default: 7.
SESSION_TTL_DAYS=7